sequenceDiagram
    actor Coordinator as Coordinator
    participant UI as React Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI Server
    participant Agent as HackathonAgent
    participant Tools as Agent Tools
    participant Policy as TriagePolicy
    participant Decider as Strands Decider 2B

    Coordinator->>UI: Submit incident report or select incident
    UI->>API: POST /api/incidents/{id}/evaluate
    API->>Agent: direct_evaluate(incident_id)

    Agent->>Tools: Lookup seeded incident data
    Tools-->>Agent: incident facts (type, location, hazards, affected_people)

    Agent->>Tools: calculate_preliminary_risk(severity, time, people, hazard)
    Note over Tools: Arithmetic only — 0-100 score<br/>Not the model's judgement
    Tools-->>Agent: preliminary_score: 80

    Agent->>Tools: get_resource_status(incident_type)
    Tools-->>Agent: Available: Swift-water Boat x2, Ambulance x5

    Agent->>Tools: list_active_incidents() [for comparison context]
    Tools-->>Agent: 10 active incidents ranked by score

    Agent->>Policy: build_state(report, facts, others, draft)
    Note over Policy: Assembles state text:<br/>protocol + report + facts + comparison + draft

    Policy->>Decider: POST /v1/decide<br/>state + 3 typed questions
    Note over Decider: One forward pass<br/>priority (score)<br/>next_action (choice)<br/>life_safety (noul)
    Decider-->>Policy: {priority: critical, next_action: escalate,<br/>life_safety: p_yes=0.82} in ~7s

    Policy->>Policy: decide(answers)<br/>p_yes≥0.6 AND confident → BLOCK
    Policy-->>Agent: Verdict: BLOCK · reason: life-safety detected

    Agent-->>API: reply + decisions log
    API->>Tools: save_decision_record(id, decision, reason, status=PROPOSED)
    API-->>UI: {decision: PROPOSED, triage_verdict: block, priority: CRITICAL}

    UI-->>Coordinator: 🚨 ESCALATE — life-safety incident<br/>Decision panel: probability bars + reason

    Coordinator->>UI: Condition change: "Resident confirmed trapped"
    UI->>API: POST /api/incidents/{id}/reassess {update: "..."}
    API->>Agent: direct_evaluate(id, context_update="...")
    Agent->>Policy: build_state(updated_report, facts, others, draft)
    Policy->>Decider: POST /v1/decide [updated state]
    Decider-->>Policy: {priority: critical, life_safety: p_yes=0.79}
    Policy-->>Agent: Verdict: BLOCK (reassessed)
    API-->>UI: Updated decision — still BLOCK, evidence updated
    UI-->>Coordinator: Reassessment complete — CRITICAL BLOCK confirmed
